{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-12_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-12",
  "title": "Frost Upon the Tundra",
  "storyCode": "6-14",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-12_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8393bfd0ab98a1b325e690a0491fb24afe6671cebca8db6e60a066dd17f2bee5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "The... the Yetis..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "...I feel so bad for them to all die in Lungmen like that. One less hope, one less legend for the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Move it. The L. G. D. are on the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "...There's something not quite right about your eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "To be honest, I always thought you were a spy for Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How about now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "No one would believe it anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A real spy would kill you to keep you quiet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "I'm not worried about you killing me. Look at the state of Lungmen. Even if you were a Lungmenite, you can't go back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "You'd have an even worse time than we did."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...So I'm not. I'm not really anything anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "What are you doing? Wow, is that a flower?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Oooh, is this your Arts? It's pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Someone has to leave them a token of respect."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Such dilly-dallying... such a waste of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think it was well done. I can give top marks for wiping out the entire Reunion Movement in the city of Lungmen in a single day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_040",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wei Yenwu is impressive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Taihe, have you heard that rumor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You speak of Wei Yenwu's history?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taihe",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_040",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Delve not into such things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forgive me. But how do the skills of the Black Cloaks compare to those of the Imperial Guard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph. You overestimate them. But they do indeed have some exceptional skill..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taihe",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_040",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You bastards!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hiss!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "——Wire?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't really want to kill me, do you? You can use Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "I've always heard that men who use wires as weapons are all, literally all, psychopaths."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Indeed, they do say that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Infected, do not interfere with official business. Take care that I lump you in with the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Not much to be done about unidentified armed units getting killed on the battlefield, is there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can likewise testify that you are acting in coordination with Reunion."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "You don't have the authority to investigate my partner."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We are well aware that a vessel belonging to an 'Infected Countermeasures Specialist' is docked in a Lungmen berth, Superintendent Ch'en. This is the only reason Miss Blaze has not yet come to harm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Then how much more do you need to see? How much more must you test the people of this city with their very lives?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Speak with respect. We are assessing Lungmen's risk control capabilities due to the importance with which we regard you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Then forgive me. I'll rephrase."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Are you enjoying this farce?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Censor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pfft."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Stand down, Blaze. We do not serve these fine, upstanding individuals, and they're not with the raincoats either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Apologies, Miss Blaze. I hope I did not cause you any displeasure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "...You're very polite. But your tone pisses me off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have an ear for Yan speech."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You inherited much from your father. Alas, now you are but an Infected. Your path is rough. And short."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......You......?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Taihe",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_040",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Goodbye then, Miss Blaze, Superintendent Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Wait! What did you just say about my dad?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Blaze!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Remember the mission!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Officer Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "We found no trace of the enemy commander."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Which?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "We only know of Mephisto."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Let Rhodes Island handle the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "No need to rush into it. This campaign is all but over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But he has to pay... for the atrocities he committed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Then we'll leave it to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Let's part ways for now. I have one more thing I need to see with my own eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Wait a minute, L. G. D. lady."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "...Thanks for that, back there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Sure. You too."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Why did you have to pick that moment to act? Blaze... You're not the type to make mistakes at a time like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "For one thing, I was really mad..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "For another, I could tell that L. G. D. lady, Ch'en, was getting mad too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We also can't tell which of the two sides has the right to speak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "So I pick the one I like."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Sorry. It won't happen again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...No, Blaze. It's my turn to say it won't happen again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But I can't say that. I can't promise that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "The Yetis..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Silly rabbit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Hey, don't pat my head. I need to get taller..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...At least, don't pat it too long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "I know, I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How do you feel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Can I help you?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "I was in the neighborhood."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Your emotional state is fluctuating. It seems you had a deeper interaction with this Reunion unit in the Chernobog ruins."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "As far as I can tell, the captain of this unit did not participate in the battle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "That means...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Lungmen won't keep chasing these Infected. But Rhodes Island has to do more."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Lungmen won't interfere with what happens next. And you can choose not to participate."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "...But you will participate. Whether the Infected is codenamed 'Mephisto' or 'FrostNova.'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Where are you going?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "I have my work cut out for me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Oh, and Dr. {@nickname}......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Don't look at me like that."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Stop with the cloak and dagger.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Amiya said Rhodes Island needs trust.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "But you and I don't need trust."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "You need the trust of Rhodes Island's operators, not me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "——I know you too well to trust you. Just like you never trusted me, in the old days."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "How would I know the old days?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "The old days?",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Is there anything I can do about it now?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Right."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "I misspoke. Forget it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Be careful in the next operation. Only the most dangerous of commanders would train such a squad of Infected who would fight to the death without flinching."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Of course, it's up to you if you want to see it through to the end."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "And do conserve your energy. We may not have time to rest."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The battle for Lungmen is over.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "It's not that simple. At least, that's what I think."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, from now on, it's up to you to decide if you will shoulder the burden of responsibility for Rhodes Island..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "...'Whether or not to be one worthy of the trust of a Rhodes Island operator.'"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Ah, FrostNova, ma'am, you're awake..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...Take it easy! Let me help you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "I'm fine. I'm not... so fragile."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Where are you going? You can't go back."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "Then, my brothers and sisters..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...You can't go back!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "It was for your sake that they..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#9",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "Don't insult my squad!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Ugh!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "They did... *cough* look out for me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "But it was for the Infected that they gave their lives so bravely!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "They fought their last battle so that more of their people could live, not for the sake of any one person!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "*Cough* *cough hack* *cough*..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "*Cough* Guh... Mmg..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "FrostNova, ma'am..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "Enough with the ma'am. Are you calling me that because I look weak to you?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Sorry!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "It's just, they put you in our care like this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "And now they're gone, and I never got to keep my promises to them."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "I don't even have a chance to make amends."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "FrostNova..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "...The one slumped at the wall there."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "Mephisto."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "He's still unconscious?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We don't know. He's been like that the whole time. He says nothing. Does nothing."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "Take him back. It's enough."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Understood. Phew, I thought you'd..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "I'd what?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I thought you'd kill him."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "There's no need for that anymore. I think I know what happened outside the slums."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "That disheartened look in his eyes..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Oh...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "...And, from time to time..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "I recall that day, three or four years ago, when he tried his very hardest to sing."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "He can sing? But Faust said, his throat..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "He really tried."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "Just like all of us Infected. Though we will all someday succumb to Oripathy..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "We still try our very hardest to live."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "Let the rest of his life continue to punish him."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "Tell me, Phantom Crossbowman, was Rhodes Island involved in that fight?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Do you mean...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...No, as far as I know, they didn't fight the Yetis."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "...So childish."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Are you sure you want to stay?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "They may not come after us, FrostNova. You don't have to die here."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "I met a few people in the ruins. I want to see them again."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "I promised them, actually."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "And I know they're coming."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "FrostNova..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Go on, brother."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "FrostNova",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Reunion lost this battle. And just maybe, Reunion did wrong."
        },
